error[type-mismatch] 15:12-15:22
    (sort-by (fn [x] x)
             ^^^^^^^^^^
  sort-by needs a key that is an Int, Float, String, Bool, or a tuple of them.
  Expected: a sort key
  Found: Option<String>
  To drop none values and unwrap the rest, use (keep (fn [x] x) results).
  Help: sx help keep
